IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ra-carriage`

-- Railways Act 1905, ss 1, 36 to 45, 62 to 90 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_railways-act-1905.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

